    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>(18th Level)</em></p><p>You undertake a scene-long ritual capable of altering a place, hex, or community meaningfully.</p><p>This is not damage.</p><p>This is transformation.</p><p>Examples:</p><ul><li><p>Rewriting the ambient correspondence of a location.</p></li><li><p>Stabilizing a corrupted district.</p></li><li><p>Rebalancing a fractured symbolic structure.</p></li><li><p>Shifting the long-term identity of a community.</p></li></ul><h3>Cost</h3><p>Once per arc.</p><p>the misfire ladder applies. Backlash is possible.</p><p>But when completed properly, the world does not explode.</p><p>It changes quietly—and permanently.</p><p></p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
